<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Correct a Daily quiz | AK Explained</title>
<meta name="description" content="Owner-only page for replacing the questions of a Daily quiz.">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
<link rel="icon" href="/assets/logo.png" type="image/png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Literata:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site.css">
</head>
<body data-admin="daily">
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

<header class="site-header"></header>

<main id="main">

<section class="pagehead">
  <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">Q</span>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Owner only</p>
    <h1>Correct a Daily quiz</h1>
    <p class="lede">Put a corrected set of questions on one of the Daily quizzes. Choose the quiz, choose the file, check what the page found, then publish. The quiz is usually updated in about two to three minutes.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap authwrap">

  <nav id="adminNav" class="adminnav" aria-label="Admin tools" hidden></nav>

  <div id="dqNotice" class="authnotice" role="status">Checking your account&hellip;</div>

  <div id="dqBody" hidden>

    <div class="fqwarn" role="note">
      <h2>This replaces a quiz students are already using</h2>
      <p>Every Daily quiz is free and open to everyone, so a new file goes straight to them. <strong>Question ids must stay the same</strong>, because each student&rsquo;s saved progress hangs on them: change the words of a question if it is wrong, but never give an old id to a different question. This page can only replace a quiz that is already on the website &mdash; a brand-new quiz needs its page written first, so ask Claude for that.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="authcard">
      <h2>1. Which quiz is this?</h2>
      <label class="field">
        <span>The quiz</span>
        <select id="dqBank">
          <option value="">Choose a quiz&hellip;</option>
        </select>
        <span class="hint" id="dqBankHint"></span>
      </label>
      <p class="small" id="dqBankNow" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="authcard" id="dqFileCard" hidden>
      <h2>2. Choose the question file</h2>
      <div class="formerror" id="dqFileError" role="alert" hidden></div>
      <label class="field">
        <span>Question file (.json)</span>
        <input id="dqFile" type="file" accept=".json,application/json">
        <span class="hint">One file, the whole quiz. It may be a plain list of questions or the full file with its heading.</span>
      </label>
    </div>

    <div class="authcard" id="dqChecksCard" hidden>
      <h2>3. What the page found</h2>
      <ul class="uprep" id="dqChecks"></ul>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="dqPreviewBtn" type="button" hidden>Show what changes</button>
    </div>

    <div class="authcard" id="dqPreviewCard" hidden>
      <h2>4. What changes</h2>
      <p class="small">The questions whose words, options, answer or reason are not the same as the quiz on the website now. The first ten are shown.</p>
      <div id="dqPreview"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="authcard" id="dqGo" hidden>
      <h2>5. Publish</h2>
      <div class="formerror" id="dqError" role="alert" hidden></div>
      <p class="small" id="dqSummary"></p>
      <label class="field admcheck">
        <input id="dqConfirm" type="checkbox">
        <span>I have checked the changes above, and I want this to replace the quiz on the website.</span>
      </label>
      <button class="btn" id="dqButton" type="button" disabled>Publish this quiz</button>
      <p class="small">Publishing saves the file and starts the build. The quiz is usually updated in about two to three minutes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="authcard" id="dqDone" hidden>
      <h2 id="dqDoneTitle">Done</h2>
      <p class="upverdict" id="dqVerdict" role="status"></p>
      <ul class="uprep" id="dqDoneReport"></ul>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="dqCheckBtn" type="button" hidden>Is it live yet?</button>
      <p class="small" id="dqCheckNote" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <div class="upcopy" id="dqCopy" hidden>
        <p class="small"><strong>Something needs fixing.</strong> Press the button, then paste the text to Claude.</p>
        <textarea id="dqCopyText" rows="8" readonly aria-label="Text to paste to Claude"></textarea>
        <button class="btn" id="dqCopyBtn" type="button">Copy this for Claude</button>
        <span class="small" id="dqCopyNote" aria-live="polite"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

</main>

<footer class="site-footer"></footer>

<script type="application/json" id="dqPlan">{{ dailyBanks.json | safe }}</script>
<script src="/assets/admin.js" defer></script>
<script src="/assets/upload-daily.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
